Short:        keeps assembly-sources uptodate
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

                        BumpRevision Deluxe V2.200


DESCRIPTION
        This is a tool for all assembly language programmers  who
        want to document the changes at the different  revisions.
        BumpRevision    Deluxe    generates    the     well-known
        $REVISION-HEADER autoMAGICally and allows you to  comment
        the changes.

        In spite  of  the  existing  tools,  BumpRevision  Deluxe
        features the  typical  OS  2.xxx  userinterface  and  was
        written in pure assembly-language for maximum  speed  and
        minimum size.


